% Whether an evaluation meets an undefined result depends on the bindings
% its expressions are evaluated over.  The Magic rewrite of p(1, Y)?
% evaluates the rule for X = 1 alone and answers; full materialization,
% under -X no-magic, evaluates it for X = 0 too and fails.
n(0). n(1).

p(X, Y) :- n(X), Y = 1 / X.

p(1, Y)?
